    "preamble": "Chhedalal vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 30 May, 2022 Bench: Ashwani Kumar Mishra, Rajnish Kumar High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 44 Case :- Criminal Misc. Writ Petition No. - 6325 of 2022 Petitioner :- Chhedalal Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 3 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Rajat Agarwal,Virpratap Singh Counsel for Respondent :- G.A. Hon'ble Ashwani Kumar Mishra,J. Hon'ble Rajnish Kumar,J. Heard learned counsel for the petitioner and learned A.G.A. for the State. This writ petition has been filed with the prayer to quash the First Information Report dated 04.05.2022, registered as Case Crime No.0063 of 2022, under Sections 420, 467, 468, 471, 272, 273 Ipc and Section 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, Police Station-Jalalpur, District-Hamirpur.",
